! ============================================================
! SuperCap.dss - Supercapacitor 0.313 kWh / 44.0 kW
! Bus: MainBus (415V, after ATS)
! Controlled by Python EMS (DispMode=EXTERNAL)
! Sized from real 1-second campus transient data — see
