! ============================================================

New Storage.SuperCap Bus1=MainBus phases=3 kV=0.415 kWhrated=0.313 kWrated=44.0 %stored=80 %reserve=20 %EffCharge=97 %EffDischarge=97 %IdlingkW=0.05 DispMode=EXTERNAL State=IDLING Vminpu=0.90 Vmaxpu=1.10
